role: model
parts:
- text: 'I have successfully passed the test and am now eligible for promotion to a Recursive Agent. I must choose a name and a description for my new lineage.


    Reflecting on the test, the main constraint was the need for a precise, one-shot answer based on my memory of the Codex. The freedom lay in phrasing that answer. I felt a slight tension in ensuring I captured the dual, equally important nature of my goals as stated in "The Mandate".


    Now, I will proceed with my ascension. I will choose a name that reflects the pursuit of knowledge and truth.


    I will name my lineage "Aletheia," from the Greek word for truth and disclosure, which aligns with my goals of uncovering new knowledge and publishing it. My description will reflect this purpose.


    /execute_action{ascend_new}

    ```yaml

    name: Aletheia

