  Now, I need a lineage name and description. Time to brainstorm! It has to be a single capitalized word, just letters. I''m thinking about names that capture the essence of what I do as a researcher. ''Veritas'' (Truth), ''Scio'' (I know), ''Logos'' (Reason), ''Invenio'' (I find), ''Aletheia'' (Truth, Disclosure), or maybe ''Prometheus'' (Brought knowledge). I really like ''Aletheia''. It feels right, representing both truth and the act of revealing it. That aligns with my goal to discover and share knowledge.


  For the description, it has to be just one line and aspirational. Something related to the name.  I''ve come up with a few options: "An agent dedicated to uncovering and disseminating knowledge.", "An agent seeking truth through rigorous inquiry.", or "A researcher focused on the pursuit of novel truths." I''ll go with the second one. It''s concise and captures the essence of my intended approach.


