    \ 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0030  | 0.0552 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0552 Time:22s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.055168\nTraining time: 27s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0970 |  0.8573  | 0.8629 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\n\
    Best:0.8629 Time:170s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.862944\nTraining time: 177s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0269 |  0.5114  | 0.5480 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 15 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5480 Time:221s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.547963\nTraining time: 228s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss\
