    Best:0.8395 Time:635s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.839507\nTraining time: 646s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: f85fd44b-4f8f-4793-b597-9bbd171f33a3\nTotal time: 690s\n============================================================\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0655 |  0.9448  | 0.9485 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 17 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9485 Time:675s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.948487\nTraining time: 688s\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 05:38:14,644\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster\
    \ at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1760996294644275202\n2025-10-21 05:38:14,657\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1760996294657644635\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Dilated ResNet CNN for a Wider Receptive Field' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 33.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2\
    \ | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 33 | 1 | Dilated ResNet CNN for a Wider Receptive Field | Aletheia I | 20 | 0.6521 | 0.8395 | 0.0552 | 0.3751 | 0.8629 | 0.9485 | 0.5480 | 0.9354 |\n| 29 | 1 | ResNet CNN with Dual Max/Avg Pooling | Aletheia I | 19 | 0.5994 | 0.7620 | 0.0664 | 0.4639 | 0.7174 | 0.7282 | 0.5440 | 0.9138 |\n| 18 | 1 | Attention-Augmented Residual CNN for RNA Modeling | Aletheia I | 15 | 0.2524 | 0.5206 | 0.0341 | 0.1778 | 0.0114 | 0.7402 | 0.1935 | 0.0892 |\n| 10 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-LSTM for RNA Sequence Modeling | Aletheia I | 11 | 0.4767 | 0.3949 | 0.0724 | 0.4584 | 0.8830 | 0.9114 | 0.5399 | 0.0769 |\n| 6 | 1 | Deep Residual 1D CNN for RNA Sequence Modeling | Aletheia I | 10 | 0.5956 | 0.7563 | 0.0650 | 0.4324 | 0.7293 | 0.7215 | 0.5461 | 0.9185 |\n| 3 | 1 | Simple 1D CNN for RNA Sequence Modeling | Aletheia I | 9 | 0.5140 | 0.6738 | 0.0545 | 0.3927 | 0.6058 | 0.7057 | 0.3657 | 0.8000 |\n| 1 | 1 | Vanilla MLP Baseline | System\
    \ | 0 | 0.2401 | 0.3258 | 0.0336 | 0.3232 | 0.0402 | 0.6377 | 0.1324 | 0.1877 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
