    =============================================\n 10  | 0.0637 |  0.9031  | 0.9031 \n 20  | 0.0001 |  0.9262  | 0.9262 \n 30  | 0.0000 |  0.9262  | 0.9292 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 33 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9292 Time:1386s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.929231\nTraining time: 1392s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0581 |  0.9439  | 0.9473 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 14\n=============================================\nBest:0.9473 Time:1838s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.947259\n\
    Training time: 1852s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0121 |  0.8352  | 0.8381 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 15\n=============================================\nBest:0.8381 Time:1870s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.838143\nTraining time: 1881s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: c6483bbc-4883-4000-a0b1-8ea6fac7919c\nTotal time: 1884s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 09:03:10,279\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761008590280126289\n2025-10-21 09:03:10,293\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761008590293446797\n\
