    \  | 0.0049 |  0.3748  | 0.4228 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 22 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4228 Time:13s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.422808\nTraining time: 18s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0471  | 0.0645 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0645 Time:111s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.064529\nTraining time: 116s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2,\
